The code here reflects the beginnings of an effort to treat Re as an
isotopologue-dependent parameter.  This was inspired by the very steep radial
behaviour of the adiabatic  S_{ad}(r) function being determined for MgH, which
suggested that a small shift of Re might account for several S_{ad}(r)
parameters.

The only .h file changed (so far) was BLKPOT.h

The .f files that were changed were:
               READPOT.f
               WRITEPOT.f
